{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. The native <dialog> every page popup sits in (Countdown
  Promo Popup, Coupon Promo Popup, Promotion Popup Discount, Promotional
  Newsletter 2, Image Banner Popup, Signup Discount Popup, Promotional
  Popup 2, Spin Wheel Popup). Rendered by those sections only:
  {% render 'page-popup-dialog', sid: section.id, st: section.settings %}

  The section keeps its own look: the dialog box itself is invisible and
  never takes the closed state away (display stays block), so the section's
  own fade in and out still play, and a closed popup's parts stay hidden by
  the section's own visibility rules. shopify/assets/live-page-popups.js
  opens it with showModal() on the live site (the page behind is inert,
  Escape closes it) and with show() in the theme editor, where it is drawn
  over the page the same way (not modal, so other sections stay selectable).

  Custom fonts (the section's Typography: Custom fonts, Heading font, Text
  font) are opt in. On, the root ([data-pg-root], which then carries
  data-pg-fonts and data-own-font) gives the theme's font variables the
  picked families in its style (snippets/page-popup-fonts), so every rule of the section that reads
  var(--heading-font), var(--body-font) or var(--btn-font) draws them, and
  Theme settings > Typography "Use in every section" leaves the popup be.
  Off, nothing is printed and the theme fonts apply.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if st.enable_custom_fonts -%}
<style>
  {%- if st.heading_font.family != blank -%}{{ st.heading_font | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if st.body_font.family != blank -%}{{ st.body_font | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}{%- endif -%}
</style>
{%- endif -%}
<style>
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog] {
    display: block;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: none;
    max-height: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
    background: transparent;
    color: inherit;
    overflow: visible;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog]::backdrop { background: transparent; }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-pg-fonts] { font-family: var(--body-font); }
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog]:modal,
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog][data-pg-live][open] { pointer-events: auto; }
  /* the card takes focus as the popup opens; its own buttons show the ring */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} [data-pg-card]:focus { outline: none; }
  /* Theme editor (opened with show(), not modal, so the editor can still
     select other sections): drawn as a real overlay over the page, exactly
     like the live popup, never in the page flow under the footer. */
  #shopify-section-{{ sid }} dialog[data-pg-dialog][open]:not(:modal) {
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 2147483000;
  }
</style>